## 🔌 API Endpoint Summary

| Domain | Method | Endpoint | Access Level | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Auth** | `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | Public | Authenticates user and creates session cookie. |
| **Auth** | `POST` | `/api/auth/logout` | Authenticated | Clears user session. |
| **Auth** | `GET` | `/api/auth/me` | Public | Returns current logged-in user profile & permissions. |
| **Users** | `GET` | `/api/users` | `manage:users` | Lists dashboard accounts with role/status filters. |
| **Users** | `POST` | `/api/users/create` | `manage:users` | Creates new dashboard user account. |
| **Users** | `PUT` | `/api/users/<id>` | `manage:users` | Updates dashboard user details or assigned role. |
| **Servers**| `GET` | `/api/inventory` | Authenticated | Returns parsed Ansible inventory groups & hosts. |
| **Servers**| `POST` | `/api/servers/add` | `manage:servers` | Appends new server host to `inventory.ini` & MySQL. |
| **Servers**| `POST` | `/api/servers/update`| `manage:servers` | Edits server hostname, IP, or group in inventory. |
| **Servers**| `POST` | `/api/servers/remove`| `manage:servers` | Removes server host from `inventory.ini` & MySQL. |
| **Keys** | `POST` | `/api/keys/deploy` | `write:keys` | Deploys key action (`add`, `remove`, `disable`, `enable`). |
| **Keys** | `POST` | `/api/keys/share_execute` | `write:keys` | Copies public keys between Linux servers/users. |
| **Search** | `GET` | `/api/search/global` | `read:keys` | High-speed global search across MySQL key indexes. |
| **Matrix** | `GET` | `/api/matrix` | `read:keys` | Returns full Server-User Access Matrix summary. |
| **Sync** | `POST` | `/api/sync/start` | `trigger:sync` | Triggers background Ansible inventory discovery. |

